:: Decision1 {"position":"1150,300","size":"100,100"}
You approach the stand and step up onto a stone platform in the water. Only the sounds of water falling onto stone fills the silence.

The man looks down at you for a moment, judging your appearance.

"Well, mortal, who were you in life?"

Memories flood your mind.

[[I was a soldier.->Selection 1A]]

[[I was a farmer.->Selection 1B]]

[[I was a criminal.->Selection 1C]]


:: Decision2 {"position":"1600,300","size":"100,100"}
The man asks another question,

"How did you die?"

[[An arrow from an enemy.->Selection 2A]]

[[Poison in a drink from a friend.->Selection 2B]]

[[Old age.->Selection 2C]]


:: Decision3 {"position":"2050,300","size":"100,100"}
The sounds of paper shuffling could be heard. After a while, he returned his gaze onto you.

"Which realm do you believe you should go to in the afterlife?"

[[The Honoured Halls->Selection 3A]]

[[The Common Lands->Selection 3B]]

[[The Pits of Anguish->Selection 3C]]


:: Ending {"position":"2500,300","size":"100,100"}
The man looks back down at his papers. A surprised expression rolls across his face.

"Uh, apologies, it seems you were instead slotted for reincarnation. You will be sent back to the living very soon."

Light begins to surround you. Very quickly the light becomes blinding, blocking out your surroundings. You feel your body lift in to the air, then falling...


:: Outcome1 {"position":"1450,300","size":"100,100"}
The man thinks about your answer. He stays silent.

[[Continue->Decision2]]


:: Outcome2 {"position":"1900,300","size":"100,100"}
The man nods his head as you finish telling your story. He looks down at something on his desk.

[[Continue->Decision3]]


:: Outcome3 {"position":"2350,300","size":"100,100"}
The man thought for a moment. "Very well, you may enter realm you chose."

[[Continue->Ending]]


:: Selection 1A {"position":"1300,150","size":"100,100"}
You remember a life in the army. Fighting battles for kings and lords.

[[Continue->Outcome1]]


:: Selection 1B {"position":"1300,300","size":"100,100"}
You remember a a life spent toiling in the fields. Working hard to feed your family.

[[Continue->Outcome1]]


:: Selection 1C {"position":"1300,450","size":"100,100"}
You remember a life of thievery and deceit. Always watching your back and trusting very few people.

[[Continue->Outcome1]]


:: Selection 2A {"position":"1750,150","size":"100,100"}
You think back to just moments before. You were in a tough battle, focusing on the enemies in front of you and did not notice an archer on the ridge in the distance. 

Only in the final moment did you whip you head around in time to see the arrows whistling through the air at your head.

[[Continue->Outcome2]]


:: Selection 2B {"position":"1750,300","size":"100,100"}
You think back to just moments before. You were in a tavern with a friend. Someone you thought you trusted more than anyone else. You took a drink from your cup, and begin to feel dizzy. 

Your friend looks at you and says: "I'm sorry it had to come to this."

The dizziness strengthens, until everything goes dark.

[[Continue->Outcome2]]


:: Selection 2C {"position":"1750,450","size":"100,100"}
You think back to just moments before. You were resting peacefully in your bed. Your spouse next to you. You reflect back to the last few years of your life, most of it spent happily with your family.

You are calm, and slowly drift into sleep.

[[Continue->Outcome2]]


:: Selection 3A {"position":"2200,150","size":"100,100"}
"Ah, the Honoured Halls." The man said. "Where those who deserve a happy and honoured afterlife go."

[[Continue->Outcome3]]


:: Selection 3B {"position":"2200,300","size":"100,100"}
"Ah, the Common Lands. Where those who did nothing remarkable reside." The man said. "Spending eternity with others who have done nothing with their lives."

[[Continue->Outcome3]]


:: Selection 3C {"position":"2200,450","size":"100,100"}
"Ah, the Pits of Anguish." The man said. "Where those who lived wickedly or those who deserve punishment go.

[[Continue->Outcome3]]


:: Start {"position":"1000,300","size":"100,100"}
Moments ago, you had just died. 

You suddenly awake in water. Sitting up, you feel the surface just below your waist. Darkness stretches endlessly into the horizon. The only thing visible is a tall stone desk, behind which sits a man in a dark suit.

You make eye contact with the man, and he gestures towards a platform in front of his bench. This small space is mysteriously illuminated by an unseen light source. Though the cold harsh light did not provide any form of comfort.

[[Walk up to the platform.->Decision1]]
